<title>CHILE: TABLE - Chile's CTC Q2 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Chile's CTC Q2 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compania de Telecomunicaciones de Chile SA reported the following consolidated earnings in the second quarter of the year.</p>
<p>				  Q2 1997	   Q2 1996</p>
<p>Net profit			34.39   profit  49.95</p>
<p>Operating profit		48.30   profit  37.51</p>
<p>Non-operating loss	    10.96   profit  17.96</p>
<p>Operating revenues	   146.86	    136.89</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of Chilean pesos. ((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212))</p>
</text>
